00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:43.150
What?

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:47.210
To be frank with you, my abilities
are better than Sora Naegino's!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:49.590
I think you should hurry up and
pull her from the stage,

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:51.920
and make me the leading star.

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:58.300
I think everyone should be honest
and admit the truth.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:15:02.100
I feel sorry for Mr. Leon that
he has such an amateur as his partner.

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:06.810
Kaleido Stage doesn't need Sora Naegino.
Don't you think so?

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:07.640
Why?!

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:08.540
What?

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:11.640
Why are you talking about Sora like that?

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:12.880
Who are you?

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:15.040
You don't even know Sora's abilities.

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:17.350
I know her abilities.

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.780
Her abilities are no match for mine.

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.550
Sora is amazing!

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:24.180
How can someone like you
know anything about Sora?

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.820
Oh my! Aren't you Rosetta?

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:28.200
Oh, shoot!

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:28.430
Rosetta?

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:28.430
Oh, shoot!

00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:28.960
Rosetta?

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:29.060
Rosetta?

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:29.060
The diabolo star?

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:29.790
The diabolo star?

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.830
Oh, I didn't know.

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:34.160
You may be a diabolo genius,

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:36.870
but this is a Kaleido Stage matter!

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.270
It's got nothing to do with you!

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:40.530
Rosetta?!

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.110
Oh, there you are!

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:45.580
Hey! Your agent's looking for you!

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:47.980
If there's a reason why you're here,
you should talk to her!

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:10.040
You can't be my partner the way you are now.

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:12.160
I'll reduce your part further tomorrow.

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:13.610
Yes.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.840
Something like this is not Kaleido Stage.

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:22.750
I wonder if we can create performances
with this man in the future.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.690
Mr. Leon looked so great.

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:25.710
I think I'll come back here again tomorrow.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:29.560
She just entered the Kaleido Stage.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:30.820
That's right.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.120
Thank you.

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:49.680
I'm sorry that Rosetta has imposed on you.

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:50.680
Not at all.

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:53.670
But, I wonder why Rosetta
came to Kaleido Stage.

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:56.480
Well, she...

00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:57.780
Rosetta?!

00:16:58.190 --> 00:17:00.120
Rosetta!

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:04.050
Hey, wait, Rosetta!

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:05.230
Rosetta?!

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.160
Oh, Sora.

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:07.060
Rosetta just ran through here!

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.360
This way?

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:10.660
Rosetta!

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:12.790
The agent who whips her a thousand times?!

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:14.330
Where'd she go?

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:15.800
This way!

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:39.820
Rosetta!

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:47.160
Rosetta, get down here!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:48.730
No. Go away!

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:50.470
That's enough!

00:17:50.470 --> 00:17:51.740
Please wait!

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:54.240
Please listen to Rosetta's story!

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:56.880
Rosetta wants to join Kaleido Stage!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.110
What?!

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:00.980
I'll cancel the contract with my agent!

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:03.080
I'll work for you for newcomer's fees!

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:04.110
So, what do you say, Kalos?

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:05.590
We'll take her.

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:08.060
I won't let you have your own way!

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:09.720
But I think we should take Rosetta's
feelings into consideration.

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:11.950
You still can't make it on your own!

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:14.550
I'm not a kid anymore, Mama!

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:15.830
Mama?

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.220
Can't you listen to what I say?

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:20.770
Please understand, Mama.

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:23.900
This place is very special to me!

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:28.730
When I thought that perfecting the performance
was the most important thing,

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:32.780
they taught me the performance was something
we create with the audience.

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:38.280
I was able to get back the feelings
I had when I started doing diabolo.

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:41.990
And that's not all!

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:44.630
After I saw Sora and Miss Layla
perform the legendary great maneuver,

00:18:44.630 --> 00:18:47.720
the door which had been closed
inside of me finally opened.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.390
I wished I could perform
an amazing show like that too.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:54.340
That's all I can think about everyday,

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:56.460
and I can't stay still!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:57.840
Rosetta...

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:01.700
For the first time, I aspired
to be like somebody.

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:05.040
I want to appear on stage with Sora!

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:08.510
I can even do the trapeze!

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:09.580
What?!

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:10.380
Rosetta!

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.060
Rosetta!

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:21.390
Rosetta!

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:32.940
Sora...

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:34.980
You're so reckless, Rosetta.

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:35.940
I'm sorry.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:38.350
We're going back.

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:39.510
Okay.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:54.120
Rosetta... she's laughing.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.190
There!

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:58.630
Sora, thank you.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:19:59.660
Rosetta...

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.770
What I'm most afraid of, Rosetta...

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:09.510
Is that you may turn into a
diabolo machine again.

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:14.050
You're very hard on yourself.

00:20:14.050 --> 00:20:19.510
To be certain, I'm the one who trained you
so hard when you were little, but...

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:23.490
After you became the youngest champion
on the record in the world,

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:26.560
you strove for greater perfection,

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:29.030
and you tended to drive yourself into corners.

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:30.660
Mama...

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:33.900
But it's tough to see you like that.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:37.160
I'm the one who raised you like that...

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:40.140
but if you put yourself in
a tough environment again,

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:41.270
I'm certain you will...

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:43.110
Mama...

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:49.110
It's true, you were scary when
I was little, and you were strict.

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:52.020
But I'm very grateful
that you taught me diabolo.

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:54.660
Don't worry, Mama.

00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:57.320
I won't be a machine anymore.

00:20:58.260 --> 00:21:00.290
I'm sure she'll be mortified and she'll cry.

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:01.760
She'll have to go through all kinds of things,

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.660
and she won't be able to smile all the time,

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:06.800
but I don't think she'll
have time to be a machine.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:11.770
You're right.

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:15.670
This is the place that let you
regain your smile, after all.

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:17.980
Mr. Kalos.

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:19.710
May I ask you to take care of Rosetta?

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:20.680
Of course.

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.580
But, when she does diabolo performances,

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:25.020
I expect you to pay the fees
we already agreed on.

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:25.850
What?!

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:26.680
Oh...

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:29.620
So, I can stay here. Right?

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:31.220
Yes, you can.

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:32.330
We did it!

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:37.290
I have some business with other artists,
so I'll be leaving now.

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:40.000
Call me when you have a problem.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.270
Mama...

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:43.630
I love you, Mama!

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:53.310
They're such a nice mother and daughter.

00:21:55.220 --> 00:21:57.780
Welcome to Kaleido Stage!

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:00.150
Nice to meet you.

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:02.590
May and Leon didn't show up.

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:04.290
Huh? Where is Sora?

00:22:04.290 --> 00:22:05.850
She was here a second ago.

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:07.690
She left here with a piece of cake.

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:10.550
Who cares about the welcoming party?!

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:16.200
Uh, I thought it would be nice if you could
at least have a piece of cake with us.

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:34.960
<i>All kinds of hard luck flocks your way
as if it's spurring you on</i>

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:34.960
<i>Sekasu you ni muragaru Hard luck</i>

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:38.190
<i>Swept away by it, time is over</i>

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:38.190
<i>Nagasarete Time is over</i>

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:42.000
<i>Just as it was predicted, take it easy</i>

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:42.000
<i>Yokoku douri Take it easy</i>

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:46.430
<i>I will get you out right away</i>

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:46.430
<i>Tsuredasu yo imasugu</i>

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:48.140
<i>Hurry up (Here we go)</i>

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:48.140
<i>Hurry up (here we go)</i>

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:50.100
<i>Forcibly only (Drive with the fastest speed)</i>

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:50.100
<i>Gouin only (saisoku drive)</i>

00:22:50.100 --> 00:22:53.370
<i>The view I look down at every day is the best</i>

00:22:50.100 --> 00:22:53.370
<i>Nichijo miorosu best view</i>

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:55.810
<i>Sunset point (Favorite)</i>

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:55.810
<i>Sunset point (favorite)</i>

00:22:55.810 --> 00:22:57.710
<i>Harbor light (Stormy night)</i>

00:22:55.810 --> 00:22:57.710
<i>Harbor light (stormy night)</i>

00:22:57.710 --> 00:23:01.510
<i>Escape for the sake of tomorrow</i>

00:22:57.710 --> 00:23:01.510
<i>Asuno tame ni escape</i>

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:08.190
<i>Even I don't have a vacation,
I've got an oasis</i>

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:08.190
<i>Bakansu nashi demo oashisu wa get</i>

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:14.620
<i>I'll turn off the cell phone
and charge my love</i>

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:14.620
<i>Keitai off tte ai o charge shite</i>

00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:19.470
<i>Because some pain,
you can't soothe with just kindness</i>

00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:19.470
<i>Yasashisa dake ja iyasenai itami mo aru kara</i>

00:23:19.470 --> 00:23:23.330
<i>We are alone. We pass each other</i>

00:23:19.470 --> 00:23:23.330
<i>We are alone. Surechigau</i>

00:23:23.770 --> 00:23:24.740
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:23.770 --> 00:23:24.740
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:30.000
<i>At the far end of regret,
I encounter my true heart</i>

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:30.000
<i>Koukai no hate ni deau true heart</i>

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:37.380
<i>Whether I'm crying or laughing,
I will be with you</i>

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:37.380
<i>Naite mo waratte mo I'll be with U</i>

00:23:40.420 --> 00:23:42.720
Next Kaleido Star: New Wings

00:23:42.790 --> 00:23:44.090
It doesn't matter which one.

00:23:44.090 --> 00:23:45.290
Just satisfy me.

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:48.520
And so, Mia's idea for the new
performance is "Dracula".

00:23:48.660 --> 00:23:50.900
It's mysterious, but it's also a
passionate love story.

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:52.470
But, May made a big fuss again,

00:23:52.470 --> 00:23:54.430
saying that she should be Leon's partner.

00:23:54.430 --> 00:23:55.640
The deadline is a day away.

00:23:55.640 --> 00:23:58.370
For Miss Layla who entrusted me
with her dream and for everybody else,

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:02.400
I will never be defeated! Never! Never!

00:24:02.510 --> 00:24:03.440
Next Kaleido Star,
"The Amazing Passionate Rival"

